Error [E0301]: `impl Missing` needs a user-defined type
  --> tests/ui/impl_unknown_type.jet:1:6
    |
  1 | impl Missing {
    |      ^^^^^^^
 Why: No struct, enum, or distinct type named `Missing` is declared here, and an `impl` only extends a declared type
 Fix: Declare `struct Missing`, `enum Missing`, or `Missing :: distinct …` first, or check the spelling
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0301
